ype":"movie","sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/2011","fetchedAt":"2026-11-08T03:51:53.590Z","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","title":{"value":"Persepolis","language":"fr-FR"},"originalTitle":"Persepolis","overview":{"value":"La storia di Marjane, una ragazza precoce e ribelle che, cresciuta portando scarpe da ginnastica e giocando alla lotta con i maschietti, si trova costretta ad affrontare, dall'infanzia all'età adulta,  drastici cambiamenti delle proprie abitudini di vita imposti prima dalla monarchia dello Scià e poi dal regime degli ayatollah, fino alla sua partenza per l'Europa.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"The film Iran didn't want the world to see.","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"2007-06-27","status":"Released","rating":7.873,"ratingCount":2275,"genres":["Animazione","Dramma"],"countries":["France","United States of America"],"facts":{"Runtime":"95m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":20710,"name":"Chiara Mastroianni","role":"Marjane (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tFqa9RlIFn2wxI4TTK5btzvJxVq.jpg"},{"id":236016,"name":"Danielle Darrieux","role":"Marjane's Grandmother (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l8YlVUlaJw83YQ3mmqmM1iO3KI7.jpg"},{"id":50,"name":"Catherine Deneuve","role":"Marjane's Mother (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7NS1KuwxTIzyMcpNGKBGlSV0Hqo.jpg"},{"id":10917,"name":"Simon Abkarian","role":"Marjane's Father (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rpw1AujIl0vJD6cyMDo2ykJ8rZA.jpg"},{"id":43779,"name":"Gabrielle Lopes Benites","role":"Young Marjane (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sT42OusRhtSWGYlWuKpnW3LfoD8.jpg"},{"id":43780,"name":"François Jérosme","role":"Uncle Anouche (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ffAYGUrSIAFM7vSaw6J0amCdiRT.jpg"},{"id":585604,"name":"Tilly Mandelbrot","role":"Lali (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3cmogYn3cTJw8w8F8B5bDpwvLQJ.jpg"},{"id":1702439,"name":"Sophie Arthuys","role":"Walla (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cV0LzmP4ZTv1DFNOf3Ni808rb22.jpg"},{"id":82302,"name":"Arié Elmaleh","role":"Walla (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sybQRpiKcRNCdtSyZ5ZGrH9rbYq.jpg"},{"id":82187,"name":"Mathias Mlekuz","role":"Walla (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e0gryLs0wxbiMSwOr71F423rB39.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","overview":"La storia di Marjane, una ragazza precoce e ribelle che, cresciuta portando scarpe da ginnastica e giocando alla lotta con i maschietti, si trova costretta ad affrontare, dall'infanzia all'età adulta,  drastici cambiamenti delle proprie abitudini di vita imposti prima dalla monarchia dello Scià e poi dal regime degli ayatollah, fino alla sua partenza per l'Europa."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"In 1970s Iran, Marjane 'Marji' Satrapi watches events through her young eyes and her idealistic family of a long dream being fulfilled of the hated Shah's defeat in the Iranian Revolution of 1979. However as Marji grows up, she witnesses first hand how the new Iran, now ruled by Islamic fundamentalists, has become a repressive tyranny on its own.","tagline":"The film Iran didn't want the world to see."},{"language":"fr-FR","title":"Persepolis","overview":"S'inspirant de son roman autobiographique, Marjane Satrapi a écrit et réalisé ce film d'animation qui raconte l'histoire d'une jeune Iranienne grandissant pendant la Révolution islamique. Envoyée dans un pensionnat autrichien, la précoce Marji découvre que son origine ethnique alimente les préjugés raciaux. Devenue adulte, la société iranienne la contraint à quitter à nouveau son pays pour la France, où elle espère enfin affirmer son identité culturelle dans un contexte de liberté et d'égalité bafouées.","tagline":"Survivre à la révolution et à la guerre n'est que le début de la bataille"}],"images